<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  SYNTHETIC PADnext Auftragsdatei (order file) for the payload beside it.

  echtdaten="0" means TEST DATA. The spec says test data must not be processed in a production
  system; this project's rule is the mirror image — it processes ONLY test data, and
  app/padnext/audit.py refuses a delivery flagged echtdaten="1" unless PADNEXT_ALLOW_REAL_DATA=1.

  verschluesselung verfahren="0" means unencrypted. A real delivery would be PKCS#7, which this
  proof of concept reports as unsupported rather than half-handling.

  dateilaenge/@pruefsumme and @laenge are placeholders here: a conforming sender computes them over
  the payload, and this file is hand-written.
-->
